*.meta binary
*.unity binary
*.prefab binary
*.mat binary
*.anim binary
*.controller binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.tga binary
*.gif binary
*.bmp binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.exr binary
*.fbx binary
*.obj binary
*.blend binary
*.dll binary
*.bytes binary